[Music]  meagan Marco breaks her silence ahead of  the royal wedding there about a million  things with this wedding that aren't  going as planned  after a report surfaced that her father  Thomas Marco would not walk her down the  aisle to marry Prince Harry after having  surgery following a heart attack  Megan set the record straight on  Thursday sharing in a statement quote  sadly my father will not be attending  our wedding  I have always cared for my father and  hope he can be given the space he needs  to focus on his health adding I would  like to thank everyone who has offered  generous messages of support please know  how much Harry and I look forward to  sharing our special day with you on  Saturday this comes after a source told  ET the bride-to-be and Harry had mixed  emotions about her dad's health as they  tried to focus on starting their lives  together I was told by sources close to  Megan last night that she was utterly  heartbroken that she couldn't believe  that this was happening just days before  her wedding still no word on who might  walk Megan down the aisle on her big day  but a source told ET on Wednesday Megan  and Harry are doing everything to focus  on their love for each other at the  moment for us is going to be making sure  that our relationship is always put  first  [Music]  [Applause]

